@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
class MediaLibrary
class Media
class Subscriber
class Loan {
- borrowedAt : Date
- returnedAt : Date [0..1]
}
MediaLibrary "1" -- "0..*" Media : inventory
MediaLibrary "1" -- "0..*" Subscriber : subscriptions
Subscriber "1" -- "0..*" Loan
Media "1" -- "0..*" Loan
note bottom of Loan
同一 Media 同时最多一笔未归还借阅
Loan 保留历史；Media 指可借实体副本

end note
@enduml
